The '''Vargo Spaceport''' was a [[spaceport]] [[City|town]] on the [[desert]] [[planet]] [[Varkana]].<ref name="The Missing Agent" /> It contained a [[Losha Tarkon's cantina|cantina]], which the [[Nakano Lash's crew|crew]] of the [[Nautolan]] [[bounty hunter]] [[Nakano Lash]] visited during the [[Imperial Era]].<ref name="Bounty Hunters 30" /> The [[Resistance]] [[spy]] [[Norath Kev]] visited the spaceport to gather information on the [[First Order]], but was discovered by the [[bounty hunter]] [[Ax Tagrin]].<ref name="The Missing Agent" />

